  moveName: Mystic Harmony
  description: "After a short startup, Meowstic levitates and creates a 5.5m protective field for 6 seconds. Meowstic remains free to move, attack, and use regular moves, but cannot score. Allies inside gain 20% movement speed and 10 cooldown-reduction points. Each ally receives a shield equal to 25% of their max HP once per cast; the shield expires when this field ends, and re-entry never replenishes it. Enemies inside are slowed by 25% and take special damage every second. Meowstic is unstoppable for the full field duration."
